WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:11.990
Come on, I don't have all night.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:18.270
Ahh! What the hell are you smoking in here?

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:25.270
Smoking? Oh-ho, none of that, my good officer.
I believe the term you are looking for is:

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.180
conjuring!

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:32.710
Cut the shit -- and give me your license and
registration.

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:39.410
Oh dear! Is there something we've done wrong,
traversing this dark avenue of the night?

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:44.930
You were going 70 on a side street and by
the looks of things, you've got a lot else

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:45.000
going on.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.880
Were we? Or was that simply, an *illusion*?

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:55.880
Are you going to give me your license and
registration, or amI going to give you a *citation*?

00:00:57.230 --> 00:01:03.899
Very well. Very well, sir.

00:01:03.899 --> 00:01:08.220
Aha! Here you are.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.580
Magician's License? I don't have time--

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.000
Look again.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.399
Cute. How about your registration.

00:01:16.399 --> 00:01:23.399
For that trick I'll need the help of my lovely:
assistant.

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:39.720
OK, on account of your speed and the smoke,
I'm going to have to give you a sobriety test.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.289
Please step out of the car.

00:01:45.289 --> 00:01:46.429
An escape act!

00:01:46.429 --> 00:01:47.000
Hey! Hey!

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:47.560
What the?

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:51.349
Alright, keep your eyes on the pen.

00:01:51.349 --> 00:01:58.349
I've had enough of this.

00:02:01.899 --> 00:02:08.899
You have the right to remain silent. Anything
you say can and will be used against you in

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:13.340
a court of law.

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:17.459
You have the right to an attorney. If you
can't afford one, one will be assigned to

00:02:17.459 --> 00:02:18.000
you.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.250
OK! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:28.250
Look, surely two gentlemen such as ourselves
can work out an agreement here.

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:35.640
Don't take this the wrong way, but the transvestite
will do... anything!

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:42.640
Ma'am... or... sir, get out of the vehicle.
Keep your hands where I can see them.

00:02:49.849 --> 00:02:56.849
What is all this shit?

00:02:58.230 --> 00:02:59.469
We have a gig tomorrow.

00:02:59.469 --> 00:03:02.799
Not anymore you don't.

00:03:02.799 --> 00:03:04.590
Ugh.

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:06.390
Hey!

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:13.390
Shazam! What do you think of that?

00:03:16.269 --> 00:03:19.170
Freeze!

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:26.170
What the hell?

00:03:27.849 --> 00:03:34.849
Looking for this?

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:40.030
Step right up and see the show of a lifetime!

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:47.030
You! That's right can experience the greatest
wonders of our world, right from where you

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:49.480
stand.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:53.420
Come watch us conjure up a little fun!

00:03:53.420 --> 00:04:00.420
Your chance is now! It's a night that you'll
never forget!

00:04:03.469 --> 00:04:04.150
Look at this guy!

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:04.999
Are you OK man?

00:04:04.999 --> 00:04:06.249
What happened? Where are they?

00:04:06.249 --> 00:04:07.540
We're right here man, we're right here!

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:14.540
You had that smoke in your face, and you fell,
and you wiped OUT man, you wiped OUT.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:19.630
So gone.

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:26.630
My shift is over, and I have a massive headache,
so I'm going to let you two go. Just don't

00:04:33.889 --> 00:04:40.889
let me catch you out here again.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.669
That's awesome!

00:04:49.669 --> 00:04:51.419
Alright!

00:04:51.419 --> 00:04:54.930
Right on!

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.690
Yeah!

